==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]] is highly recommended, not only can it tank the Relic Doges, it can also tank the Super Metal Hippoe. You should also bring a spammable attacker such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] (Especially with Critical Hit talent) or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]]. [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]] is a very good option against the Super Metal Hippoe.

If the peons start getting in the way, you can let them all stack up at the frontlines and deploy [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to wipe them out.

